---
import MainGridLayout from "@/layouts/MainGridLayout.astro";

interface Props {
	lang?: string;
}

const { lang = Astro.url.pathname.startsWith("/en") ? "en" : "zh_CN" } =
	Astro.props;
const isEn = lang === "en";

const title = isEn
	? "Chiral Cascade · The Soai Autocatalysis Lab"
	: "手性雪崩 · Soai 自催化与非线性手性放大实验室";
const description = isEn
	? "A Chiral Snowball Reaction You Can Play With: Celebrating Henri B. Kagan and Kenso Soai's 2026 Nobel Prize in Chemistry for non-linear effects and autocatalysis in asymmetric organic synthesis. Amplifying 0.00005% ee to >99.5% homochirality."
	: "手性雪崩 · CHIRAL CASCADE：致敬亨利·卡冈与硤合宪三荣获 2026 诺贝尔化学奖。交互式 2D 模拟不对称有机合成中的非线性效应与 Soai 自催化反应，探索极微小对映体过量 (0.00005% ee) 如何指数级滚雪球放大至 >99.5% ee，破译生命单一手性起源。";
---

<MainGridLayout title={title} description={description} lang={lang}>
	<div class="flex w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden relative min-h-32 mb-8">
		<div class="z-10 px-4 sm:px-8 py-8 relative w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden bg-[#050b14] text-zinc-100 border border-zinc-800/80 shadow-2xl selection:bg-cyan-500/30 selection:text-cyan-200">
			<!-- Background Ambient Glow & Subtle Grid -->
			<div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-20 bg-[radial-gradient(#06b6d4_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:24px_24px] overflow-hidden"></div>
			<div class="absolute -top-32 -left-32 w-80 h-80 bg-cyan-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute top-1/3 -right-32 w-80 h-80 bg-amber-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

			<!-- HERO HEADER SECTION -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-8 pb-8 border-b border-zinc-800/80">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-400 text-xs font-mono font-semibold tracking-wide">
							<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400 animate-pulse"></span>
							<span class="lang-zh">★ 2026 诺贝尔化学奖 · KAGAN & SOAI</span>
							<span class="lang-en">★ 2026 NOBEL PRIZE IN CHEMISTRY · KAGAN & SOAI</span>
						</div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-mono">
							<span>🧪</span>
							<span>SOAI REACTION (1995) · AUTOCATALYSIS</span>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400">
						<span class="lang-zh">2026-10-07 斯德哥尔摩宣布 · 瑞典皇家科学院</span>
						<span class="lang-en">Announced 2026-10-07 in Stockholm</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-white mb-2">
					<span class="lang-zh">手性雪崩 · CHIRAL CASCADE</span>
					<span class="lang-en">Chiral Cascade - The Soai Autocatalysis Lab</span>
				</h1>
				<p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-cyan-400 mb-4 tracking-wide font-mono">
					<span class="lang-zh">手性雪崩 · CHIRAL CASCADE — The Soai Autocatalysis Lab</span>
					<span class="lang-en">CHIRAL CASCADE — The Soai Autocatalysis Lab</span>
				</p>
				<p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-300/90 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed mb-3">
					<span class="lang-zh">
						2026 年 10 月 7 日，瑞典皇家科学院宣布将诺贝尔化学奖授予法国化学家亨利·B·卡冈（Henri B. Kagan，巴黎第十一大学荣休教授）与日本化学家硤合宪三（Kenso Soai，东京理科大学荣休教授），表彰其在不对称有机合成中发现非线性效应与自催化反应（"for the discovery of non-linear effects and autocatalysis in asymmetric organic synthesis"）。
					</span>
					<span class="lang-en">
						On October 7, 2026, the Royal Swedish Academy of Sciences awarded the Nobel Prize in Chemistry to French chemist Henri B. Kagan (Professor Emeritus, Université Paris-Sud) and Japanese chemist Kenso Soai (Professor Emeritus, Tokyo University of Science) "for the discovery of non-linear effects and autocatalysis in asymmetric organic synthesis".
					</span>
				</p>
				<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-400 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
					<span class="lang-zh">
						1995 年硤合反应（Soai reaction）：二异丙基锌与嘧啶-5-甲醛在反应中，产物直接作为自身生成的高效手性催化剂。哪怕初始对映体过量仅有 0.00005%（千万分之五），也会在数轮催化循环内指数级雪崩放大至 &gt;99.5% ee。产物催化自身诞生，多数派手性不可逆滚雪球，首次在实验室内机械化再现了生命单一手性（Homochirality）的涌现奇迹。
					</span>
					<span class="lang-en">
						The star 1995 Soai reaction: diisopropylzinc + pyrimidine-5-carbaldehyde. An initial enantiomeric excess as tiny as 0.00005% (5 parts in 10 million) was amplified autocatalytically to &gt;99.5% ee within a few cycles. The product catalyzes its own formation, so the majority handedness snowballs irreversibly—providing a mechanical answer to life's origin of homochirality.
					</span>
				</p>
			</section>

			<!-- REAL-TIME STATS BANNER -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-8">
				<div class="rounded-2xl bg-zinc-950/90 border border-cyan-500/30 p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(6,182,212,0.15)] relative overflow-hidden">
					<div class="absolute -right-16 -top-16 w-48 h-48 bg-cyan-500/10 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>

					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-3">
						<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
							<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 animate-ping"></span>
							<span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-300 font-bold">
								<span class="lang-zh">🧬 反应器手性放大动力学实时监测</span>
								<span class="lang-en">🧬 Real-Time Chiral Amplification Monitor</span>
							</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] font-mono text-cyan-400/90 bg-cyan-950/60 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-cyan-800/60 flex items-center gap-1.5">
							<span id="stat-cycle-badge">CYCLE 0</span>
							<span>·</span>
							<span id="stat-hand-badge" class="text-zinc-400">50:50 RACEMIC</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-baseline md:items-center justify-between gap-4">
						<div>
							<div class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-400 mb-1">
								<span class="lang-zh">当前对映体过量 (Enantiomeric Excess):</span>
								<span class="lang-en">Current Enantiomeric Excess (ee):</span>
							</div>
							<div class="flex items-baseline gap-3">
								<div id="stat-ee" class="font-mono text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-cyan-300 tracking-wider drop-shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(6,182,212,0.7)]">
									0.00005% ee
								</div>
								<div id="stat-dominant-tag" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-cyan-950 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-800/60">
									(S) Dominant
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 sm:gap-6 text-xs font-mono border-t md:border-t-0 md:border-l border-zinc-800 md:pl-6 pt-3 md:pt-0">
							<div>
								<span class="text-zinc-500 block">
									<span class="lang-zh">分子微观种群</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Chiral Population</span>
								</span>
								<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 mt-0.5">
									<span id="stat-left-count" class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">200 (S)</span>
									<span class="text-zinc-600">/</span>
									<span id="stat-right-count" class="text-amber-400 font-bold">200 (R)</span>
								</div>
							</div>
							<div>
								<span class="text-zinc-500 block">
									<span class="lang-zh">自催化放大倍率</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Amplification Factor</span>
								</span>
								<span id="stat-amplification" class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">1.0×</span>
							</div>
							<div>
								<span class="text-zinc-500 block">
									<span class="lang-zh">单一手性纯度目标</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Homochirality Goal</span>
								</span>
								<span class="text-amber-400 font-bold">&gt;99.5% ee</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Visual balance ratio bar -->
					<div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-zinc-800/60">
						<div class="flex justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-400 mb-1">
							<span class="text-cyan-400 font-semibold">(S) 左手性 <span id="bar-left-pct">50.0%</span></span>
							<span class="text-zinc-500">N = 400 分子池</span>
							<span class="text-amber-400 font-semibold">(R) 右手性 <span id="bar-right-pct">50.0%</span></span>
						</div>
						<div class="w-full h-2 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 overflow-hidden flex">
							<div id="bar-fill-left" class="h-full bg-cyan-400 transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(6,182,212,0.8)]" style="width: 50%;"></div>
							<div id="bar-fill-right" class="h-full bg-amber-400 transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(245,158,11,0.8)]" style="width: 50%;"></div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- INTERACTIVE SIMULATION SECTION: THE SNOWBALL LAB -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-10 pb-8 border-b border-zinc-800/80">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
					<div>
						<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2">
							<span class="text-cyan-400 font-mono text-xl">01/</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">手性雪崩自催化沙盒 · The Snowball Lab</span>
							<span class="lang-en">The Snowball Lab · Autocatalytic Canvas</span>
						</h2>
						<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">约 400 颗分子处于布朗热运动溶液中，绘制为镜面对称的手性螺旋。每轮自催化循环中，多数派分子作为催化剂主动招募并翻转少数派，观察激发的雪崩波与光环脉冲。</span>
							<span class="lang-en">About 400 molecule particles in solution, rendered as mirror-symmetric chiral pinwheels. In each cycle, majority product autocatalyzes and converts minority molecules with a visible conversion wave.</span>
						</p>
					</div>

					<!-- Presets Bar -->
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-mono">
						<span class="text-zinc-400 mr-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">经典预设:</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Presets:</span>
						</span>
						<button id="preset-soai" type="button" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-zinc-900 border border-cyan-500/60 text-cyan-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-cyan-950 transition active:scale-95" title="Soai 1995: 0.00005% ee seed snowballs to >99.5%">
							Soai 1995 (0.00005%)
						</button>
						<button id="preset-coin" type="button" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-700 hover:border-zinc-500 text-zinc-300 hover:text-white transition active:scale-95" title="Coin flip: Exactly 50/50 balance, random noise picks winner">
							Coin flip (50/50)
						</button>
						<button id="preset-lean" type="button" class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-zinc-900 border border-amber-500/50 text-amber-300 hover:text-white transition active:scale-95" title="Slight lean: 5% initial ee">
							Slight lean (5%)
						</button>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- SIMULATOR CANVAS CONTAINER -->
				<div class="relative w-full rounded-2xl bg-[#030814] border border-zinc-800 shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] overflow-hidden mb-6">
					<!-- Canvas Overlay Toast Alert -->
					<div id="cascade-toast" class="absolute top-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-20 pointer-events-none transition-all duration-300 opacity-0 -translate-y-2">
						<div class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-zinc-950/95 border border-cyan-500/50 text-xs font-mono shadow-2xl flex items-center gap-2">
							<span id="toast-icon">⚡</span>
							<span id="toast-msg" class="text-zinc-200"></span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- Canvas Legend (Top Right) -->
					<div class="absolute top-3 right-3 z-10 pointer-events-none hidden sm:flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-black/70 border border-zinc-800 text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-400 backdrop-blur-xs">
						<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
							<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 shadow-[0_0_6px_rgba(6,182,212,0.8)]"></span>
							<span class="lang-zh">左手性 (S) · 逆时针</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Left (S) · CCW</span>
						</div>
						<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
							<span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400 shadow-[0_0_6px_rgba(245,158,11,0.8)]"></span>
							<span class="lang-zh">右手性 (R) · 顺时针</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Right (R) · CW</span>
						</div>
						<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
							<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white animate-ping"></span>
							<span class="lang-zh">催化翻转脉冲</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Conversion Wave</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- MAIN SIMULATION CANVAS -->
					<canvas
						id="chiral-canvas"
						class="w-full h-[440px] sm:h-[500px] block cursor-crosshair touch-none select-none"
					></canvas>
				</div>

				<!-- INTERACTIVE CONTROLS DOCK -->
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-5 items-start">
					<!-- PRIMARY CONTROLS (Left Col: 7 cols) -->
					<div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-4">
						<!-- INITIAL IMBALANCE SLIDER CARD -->
						<div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-xl bg-zinc-950/80 border border-zinc-800/90 shadow-sm">
							<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-2">
								<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
									<span class="text-xs font-bold font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-300">
										<span class="lang-zh">初始手性不平衡度 (Initial ee)</span>
										<span class="lang-en">Initial Imbalance (Initial ee)</span>
									</span>
									<span id="slider-val-badge" class="text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-cyan-950 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-800/60">
										ee = 0.00005%
									</span>
								</div>
								<div id="seed-state-badge" class="text-[11px] font-mono font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-700 text-zinc-300">
									🧪 Soai 1995 经典起点 (5 / 10,000,000)
								</div>
							</div>

							<input
								id="slider-imbalance"
								type="range"
								min="0"
								max="100"
								step="1"
								value="0"
								class="w-full h-2 bg-zinc-800 rounded-lg appearance-none cursor-pointer accent-cyan-400"
							/>

							<div class="flex justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-500 mt-2">
								<span>0.00005% (Soai)</span>
								<span>0.1%</span>
								<span>1.0%</span>
								<span>5.0%</span>
								<span>25.0%</span>
							</div>

							<!-- Quick Imbalance Selectors -->
							<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 mt-3 pt-3 border-t border-zinc-800/80 text-xs font-mono">
								<span class="text-zinc-500 text-[11px]">
									<span class="lang-zh">快捷偏量:</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Quick ee:</span>
								</span>
								<button id="quick-ee-soai" type="button" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-700 text-zinc-300 hover:text-white transition active:scale-95 text-[11px]">
									0.00005%
								</button>
								<button id="quick-ee-coin" type="button" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-700 text-zinc-300 hover:text-white transition active:scale-95 text-[11px]">
									0.0% (50/50)
								</button>
								<button id="quick-ee-point-1" type="button" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-700 text-zinc-300 hover:text-white transition active:scale-95 text-[11px]">
									0.1%
								</button>
								<button id="quick-ee-1" type="button" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-700 text-zinc-300 hover:text-white transition active:scale-95 text-[11px]">
									1.0%
								</button>
								<button id="quick-ee-5" type="button" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-700 text-zinc-300 hover:text-white transition active:scale-95 text-[11px]">
									5.0%
								</button>
								<button id="quick-ee-25" type="button" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-700 text-zinc-300 hover:text-white transition active:scale-95 text-[11px]">
									25.0%
								</button>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- ACTION BUTTONS ROW -->
						<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
							<!-- RUN CYCLE BUTTON -->
							<button
								id="btn-run-cycle"
								type="button"
								class="flex-1 min-w-[170px] px-5 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500 hover:bg-cyan-400 text-zinc-950 font-black text-sm tracking-wide shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(6,182,212,0.4)] transition active:scale-95 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 cursor-pointer"
							>
								<span>⚡</span>
								<span>
									<span class="lang-zh">RUN CYCLE (推进催化循环)</span>
									<span class="lang-en">RUN CYCLE</span>
								</span>
							</button>

							<!-- AUTO-RUN TOGGLE -->
							<button
								id="btn-autorun"
								type="button"
								class="px-4 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-zinc-900 hover:bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-700 text-zinc-200 font-bold text-xs tracking-wide transition active:scale-95 flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer"
								title="Toggle continuous autocatalytic cycles"
							>
								<span id="autorun-icon">▶️</span>
								<span>
									<span class="lang-zh">连续自动推进</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Auto-Run Cascade</span>
								</span>
							</button>

							<!-- RE-SEED BUTTON -->
							<button
								id="btn-reseed"
								type="button"
								class="px-4 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-zinc-900 hover:bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-700 text-zinc-300 hover:text-white text-xs font-bold transition active:scale-95 flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer"
								title="Reset reactor to selected initial state"
							>
								<span>🔄</span>
								<span>
									<span class="lang-zh">重置反应池</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Re-Seed</span>
								</span>
							</button>

							<!-- NOISE NUDGE BUTTON -->
							<button
								id="btn-noise"
								type="button"
								class="px-3.5 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-zinc-900 hover:bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-800 text-amber-300 hover:text-amber-200 text-xs font-bold transition active:scale-95 flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer"
								title="Inject random fluctuation (±1 flip)"
							>
								<span>🎲</span>
								<span>
									<span class="lang-zh">热涨落扰动</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Noise Nudge</span>
								</span>
							</button>
						</div>

						<!-- TEACHING MOMENT CALLOUT (Strict requirement: one short line) -->
						<div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-cyan-950/30 border border-cyan-500/30 text-xs font-mono text-cyan-200/90 flex items-start gap-3 shadow-inner">
							<span class="text-amber-400 text-base leading-none">💡</span>
							<div class="leading-relaxed">
								<span class="font-bold text-amber-300">
									<span class="lang-zh">教学启示：</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Teaching Moment:</span>
								</span>
								<span class="lang-zh">在绝对 50/50 且零涨落的对称态下，反应池永远保持平衡；但只要存在微乎其微的哪怕一丝扰动，自催化就会将其雪崩放大为完全单一手性。</span>
								<span class="lang-en">At exactly 50/50 with zero noise the field stays balanced; any tiny nudge snowballs into complete homochirality.</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- SECONDARY DOCK (Right Col: 5 cols) - LIVE CHART & TELEMETRY -->
					<div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-4">
						<!-- EE VS CYCLE CHART CARD -->
						<div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-xl bg-zinc-950/80 border border-zinc-800/90 shadow-sm">
							<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-2">
								<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
